<title>CANADA: Canada trade minister set to go to APEC meeting.</title>
<headline>Canada trade minister set to go to APEC meeting.</headline>
<byline>Heather Scoffield</byline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's Trade Minister Art Eggleton is in good health and will leave Tuesday night for an international conference in Manila, despite being taken to hospital earlier Tuesday after he collapsed at a meeting here.</p>
<p>&quot;The last thing I heard was he's still going to Manila,&quot; Eggleton's spokeswoman Elaine McArdle told Reuters by telephone from in Ottawa. &quot;His health is great. It doesn't appear that anything is broken.&quot;</p>
</text>
